      "notes": "<p>Dear&nbsp;Cynthia,&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>To provide you with a better experience, we are pleased to let you know we have recently upgraded our software. As a result, you may notice that invoices, emails, and other communications may look different.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Please note that you have been assigned a<strong> new account number</strong>: 13397</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Please reference this new account number for payments, billing questions, and when logging into your new customer portal.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Please click <a href=\"https://frontline.fieldportals.com/forgotPassword\">here</a> and use your email or mobile phone number associated with your account to set up login access to your customer portal. Or, for quick access to your account, click the customer portal link in the upper right-hand corner of this email.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>If you have any questions, call customer support at 877-378-7280. Our normal business hours are Mon-Fri, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you for being a valued customer,&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Guillaume Bergeron</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>CEO, Frontline Pest Control</p>",
